<section class="ed-section ed-cream" id="services">
<div class="ed-wrap">
  <div class="ed-heading">
    <div><p class="ed-eyebrow">THE CONNECTED SYSTEM</p><h2>Law firm marketing that goes beyond getting clicks.</h2></div>
    <p>Each service has a job to do—from generating legal leads to helping your staff act on them. The strategy depends on your practice areas, service region and intake capacity.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="ed-automation-grid law-service-grid">
    <article tabindex="0"><span class="ed-capability-icon">⌕</span><h3>Law firm SEO</h3><p>Practice-area content, technical foundations and local visibility for relevant searches.</p></article>
