    <article tabindex="0"><span class="ed-capability-icon">◇</span><h3>Landing pages &amp; funnels</h3><p>Clear legal-service pages, conversion-focused forms and appropriate contact options.</p></article>
    <article tabindex="0"><span class="ed-capability-icon">◎</span><h3>AI reception</h3><p>Approved routine answers, callback collection and escalation to authorized staff.</p></article>
    <article tabindex="0"><span class="ed-capability-icon">▣</span><h3>CRM &amp; automation</h3><p>Lead source, response status, staff handoff and consent-based follow-up.</p></article>
    <article tabindex="0"><span class="ed-capability-icon">◈</span><h3>Tracking &amp; optimization</h3><p>Understand qualified leads and consultation progress without exposing confidential details.</p></article>
  </div>
