      <button class="ed-program active" data-program="injury" aria-pressed="true"><span>01 / TIME-SENSITIVE</span><strong>Personal Injury</strong><small>Urgent searches, calls and responsive intake</small></button>
      <button class="ed-program" data-program="family" aria-pressed="false"><span>02 / SENSITIVE NEEDS</span><strong>Family Law</strong><small>Confidentiality, clear expectations and consultations</small></button>
      <button class="ed-program" data-program="immigration" aria-pressed="false"><span>03 / SERVICE FIT</span><strong>Immigration Law</strong><small>Language, location and case-type clarity</small></button>
      <button class="ed-program" data-program="defense" aria-pressed="false"><span>04 / RESPONSIVE INTAKE</span><strong>Criminal Defense</strong><small>Accessible calls and prompt staff review</small></button>
      <button class="ed-program" data-program="estate" aria-pressed="false"><span>05 / TRUST &amp; PLANNING</span><strong>Estate Planning</strong><small>Useful education and local consultation demand</small></button>
      <button class="ed-program" data-program="business" aria-pressed="false"><span>06 / BUSINESS CLIENTS</span><strong>Business Law</strong><small>Consultative search intent and longer sales cycles</small></button>
    </div>
    <div class="ed-program-detail" aria-live="polite">
      <p class="ed-eyebrow">CAMPAIGN BLUEPRINT / <span id="ed-program-number">01</span></p>
      <div class="ed-program-symbol" id="ed-program-symbol" aria-hidden="true">⚖</div>
      <h3 id="ed-program-title">Personal Injury</h3>
      <p id="ed-program-description">Reach people searching for the practice areas your firm actually handles and make it easy to request a call.</p>
      <div class="ed-detail-line"><span>SEARCH STRATEGY</span><strong id="ed-program-ads">Local practice-area SEO and targeted high-intent search</strong></div>
      <div class="ed-detail-line"><span>LEAD SCREENING</span><strong id="ed-program-fit">Service area, matter category and callback details only</strong></div>
      <div class="ed-detail-line"><span>NEXT STEP</span><strong id="ed-program-action">Prompt review by an authorized intake professional</strong></div>
      <a href={booking} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Talk about this practice area ↗</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="ed-section ed-navy" id="intake">
<div class="ed-wrap">
  <div class="ed-heading"><div><p class="ed-eyebrow">02 / THE CLIENT ACQUISITION JOURNEY</p><h2>A new lead isn't a signed client.</h2></div><p>Explore how search traffic, lead capture and a responsible intake process work together.</p></div>
  <div class="ed-journey">
    <div class="ed-steps" role="group" aria-label="Legal lead journey">
      <button class="ed-step active" data-stage="0" aria-pressed="true"><span>01</span><strong>Attract</strong></button>
      <button class="ed-step" data-stage="1" aria-pressed="false"><span>02</span><strong>Capture</strong></button>
      <button class="ed-step" data-stage="2" aria-pressed="false"><span>03</span><strong>Screen</strong></button>
      <button class="ed-step" data-stage="3" aria-pressed="false"><span>04</span><strong>Respond</strong></button>
      <button class="ed-step" data-stage="4" aria-pressed="false"><span>05</span><strong>Consult</strong></button>
      <button class="ed-step" data-stage="5" aria-pressed="false"><span>06</span><strong>Review</strong></button>
    </div>
    <div class="ed-stage-detail" aria-live="polite">
      <span id="ed-stage-kicker">STAGE 01 / ATTRACT</span>
      <h3 id="ed-stage-title">Get found for the legal services your firm actually provides.</h3>
      <p id="ed-stage-body">Local SEO, practice-area pages and carefully targeted search ads make it easier for potential clients to find relevant information.</p>
      <div class="ed-stage-metric"><span>WHAT TO REVIEW</span><strong id="ed-stage-metric">Relevant visits, calls and qualified search intent</strong></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="ed-section ed-cream" id="automation">
<div class="ed-wrap">
  <div class="ed-heading"><div><p class="ed-eyebrow">03 / INTAKE &amp; FOLLOW-UP</p><h2>Don't lose a qualified lead between the call and the consultation.</h2></div><p>Connect advertising and the website to a practical intake workflow without automating legal judgments.</p></div>
  <div class="ed-automation-grid">
    <article tabindex="0"><span class="ed-capability-icon">◉</span><h3>AI call reception</h3><p>Handle approved routine questions and callback requests. Escalate sensitive or complex matters to firm staff.</p></article>
    <article tabindex="0"><span class="ed-capability-icon">⌘</span><h3>Website chat &amp; forms</h3><p>Help visitors find practice-area information and request contact, with clear automated-interaction disclosure.</p></article>
    <article tabindex="0"><span class="ed-capability-icon">↺</span><h3>Missed-call follow-up</h3><p>Route unanswered calls to an authorized team and coordinate consent-based reminders without making legal promises.</p></article>
    <article tabindex="0"><span class="ed-capability-icon">▣</span><h3>CRM &amp; intake routing</h3><p>Track lead source, response and consultation status. Keep confidential case information out of ad tracking.</p></article>
  </div>
  <div class="ed-automation-demo">
    <div class="ed-demo-top"><span>LEGAL INTAKE / CONCEPT DEMO</span><i>ILLUSTRATIVE</i></div>
    <div class="ed-chat"><p class="ed-chat-user">Does your firm handle estate planning? I'd like someone to call me.</p><p class="ed-chat-bot">I can help request a callback from the team. May I have your preferred contact method? I can't provide legal advice or confirm representation.</p></div>
    <p>Example only. No live AI agent, legal advice, consultation booking or attorney-client relationship is represented.</p>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="ed-section ed-light" id="planner">
<svg class="ed-atmosphere ed-atmosphere-planner" viewBox="0 0 420 260" aria-hidden="true"><g class="ed-atmosphere-drift" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><path d="M20 220H400M40 20V240"/><path d="M40 180L120 146L200 166L285 78L380 46" stroke-width="2.5"/><circle cx="40" cy="180" r="6"/><circle cx="120" cy="146" r="6"/><circle cx="200" cy="166" r="6"/><circle cx="285" cy="78" r="6"/><circle cx="380" cy="46" r="6"/></g></svg>
<div class="ed-wrap ed-planner-grid">
  <div>
    <p class="ed-eyebrow">04 / LEAD-TO-CONSULTATION PLANNER</p><h2>Model qualified leads, not just clicks and form fills.</h2>
    <p class="ed-muted">Adjust hypothetical assumptions to see how screening, responses and consultation rates interact. This is not a forecast, case-volume claim or industry benchmark.</p>
    <div class="ed-controls">
      <label for="ed-inquiries">Monthly leads <output id="ed-inquiries-label">200</output></label>
      <input id="ed-inquiries" type="range" min="50" max="1000" step="25" value="200"/>
      <label for="ed-qualified">Relevant leads <output id="ed-qualified-label">40%</output></label>
      <input id="ed-qualified" type="range" min="10" max="90" step="5" value="40"/>
      <label for="ed-contacted">Relevant leads reached <output id="ed-contacted-label">60%</output></label>
      <input id="ed-contacted" type="range" min="10" max="100" step="5" value="60"/>
      <label for="ed-applications">Reached leads who consult <output id="ed-applications-label">25%</output></label>
      <input id="ed-applications" type="range" min="5" max="80" step="5" value="25"/>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="ed-planner-result" aria-live="polite">
    <span>HYPOTHETICAL MONTHLY MODEL</span>
    <div><small>New leads</small><strong id="ed-out-inquiries">200</strong></div>
    <div><small>Relevant leads</small><strong id="ed-out-qualified">80</strong></div>
    <div><small>Reached relevant leads</small><strong id="ed-out-reached">48</strong></div>
    <div class="ed-result-highlight"><small>Potential consultations</small><strong id="ed-out-applications">12</strong></div>
    <p>Consultations do not equal signed clients, case acceptance or guaranteed legal outcomes.</p>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="ed-section ed-navy ed-principles">
<div class="ed-wrap">
  <div class="ed-heading"><div><p class="ed-eyebrow">05 / BUILT FOR TRUST</p><h2>Marketing brings the lead. Your firm makes the legal decisions.</h2></div></div>
  <div class="ed-experience">
    <div class="ed-experience-number" aria-hidden="true">01 <small>CONNECTED LEAD JOURNEY</small></div>
    <div><h3>Professional marketing. Responsible legal intake.</h3><p>LeadsFlo combines search visibility, paid ads, landing pages and CRM workflows. Your staff retain control of conflict checks, suitability, client confidentiality, legal advice and representation decisions.</p><p>Advertising and intake must follow applicable state attorney-advertising requirements. We do not claim legal specialization, past legal client results or guaranteed signed cases.</p></div>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="ed-section ed-cream" id="guides">
<div class="ed-wrap">
  <div class="ed-heading"><div><p class="ed-eyebrow">06 / INSIGHTS</p><h2>Practical guides for law firm growth.</h2></div><p>Search visibility, paid advertising, lead qualification and technology—designed around your firm's needs.</p></div>
  <div class="ed-guides">
    {guides.map(([slug,title,description],i)=>(
      <a class="ed-guide" href={`/insights/${slug}/`} aria-label={`Read ${title}`}>
        <span>0{i+1} / LAW FIRM GUIDE</span>
        <h3>{title}</h3>
        <p>{description}</p>
        <strong>Read the guide ↗</strong>
      </a>
