<section class="ed-section ed-light" id="faq">
<div class="ed-wrap ed-faq-grid">
  <div><p class="ed-eyebrow">07 / COMMON QUESTIONS</p><h2>A few things worth knowing.</h2></div>
  <div class="ed-faqs">
